<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs $1.00 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs $1.00 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00</p>
<p>higher. Demand moderate to good on a moderate movement. Top</p>
<p>$59.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>			     Country			    Plant</p>
<p>US 1-2   230-260 LBS.  57.00-58.50, few 59.00	58.00-59.50</p>
<p>US 2-3   230-260 LBS.  51.00-57.00</p>
<p>	   210-230 LBS.  46.50-51.00</p>
<p>Sows:  Steady. Top 48.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-400 LBS.  41.50-42.50, few 43.00</p>
<p>	   400-500 LBS.  42.00-44.00</p>
<p>	   500-600 LBS.  44.00-46.00</p>
<p>few over 600 LBS.  47.00-48.00</p>
